      "id": 1,
      "text": "Le Guillou, a French merchant, is celebrated as Vieques' founder, though some credit Francisco Saínz for establishing the town of Isabel Segunda.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
